   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "LilycoveCity_EventScript_RichBoy",
   "texts": {
    "LilycoveCity_Text_ImFromKanto": "I came from KANTO.\\pThe HOENN region is beautiful with\\nall its water and verdant nature.\\pHunh? Wait a second...\\pCould there be rare POKéMON that live\\nonly in this area?$"
