   "texts": {
    "LilycoveCity_Text_ImArtDealer": "I'm an ART DEALER.\\pI am a buyer and seller of fine art,\\nespecially paintings.\\pI've heard that the MUSEUM here has\\nmagnificent works on exhibit...$"
