   "texts": {
    "LilycoveCity_Text_SomeoneStoleMyPokemon": "I was taking a relaxing snooze at the\\nseaside inn to the sound of waves...\\pWhen someone stole my POKéMON!\\pWho's the abductor?\\nTEAM {EVIL_TEAM}? Is it TEAM {EVIL_TEAM}?$"
